<http://data.silknow.org/event/1c629fdd-4eba-33ee-b3a1-e12cd4a6458f>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Transferred from the India Museum in 1879. Slip book entry 3766: 'Male Clothing / Lahore / 55 / Cashmere Choga / White Robe & Red Satin Tunic & also Red Silk drawers Silk Strings attached'. 1880 Register entry: '05643. CHOGA. Scarlet cashmere, embroidered with gold. Robe, white muslin, embroidered with gold. Tunic, red satin. \"Pyjamas,\" striped red silk with silk strings; Lahore\""@en ;
        ecrm:P22_transferred_title_to  <http://data.silknow.org/actor/f0577f91-f887-3019-bf88-f9e5ba019390> ;
